       fhir:ElementDefinition.comment [ fhir:value "The type of consent (e.g. a consent to perform the related ServiceEvent, a consent for the information contained in the document to be released to a third party) is conveyed in Consent.code. Consents referenced in the CDA Header have been finalized (Consent.statusCode must equal 'completed') and should be on file." ] ;
